{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "7tlGRB", "date": "1622362339", "viewed": 135, "name": "sphere basic /w SDF", "username": "spectrum", "description": "\uc774\uc81c \uc870\uae08 \ubb54\uac00 \uc54c \uac83 \uac19\uae30\ub3c4 \ud558\uace0.\nsphere \uc5d0 pow \ud560\ub54c .3 \uacf1\ud558\ub2c8\uae4c \uca0d\ud558\ub2e4.", "likes": 1, "published": 3, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["sdf"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "float sphereSDF(vec2 pos, float r, vec2 center)\n{\n    // center\n    return pow(max(r - length(pos - center), 0.), r*.3)*2.;\n}\n\nvoid mainImage( out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord )\n{\n    // \uc911\uc559\uc744 (.5,.5)\uc73c\ub85c \uc7a1\ub294\ub2e4. \ube44\uc728\uc740 y\uae30\uc900\uc73c\ub85c \uc720\uc9c0.\n\tvec2 uv = (fragCoord-.5*iResolution.xy)/iResolution.y;\n\n    vec3 val = vec3(0,0,0);\n    \n    val += vec3(sphereSDF(uv, .05*abs(sin(200.+iTime*6.))+.25, vec2(0.,0.)) ,0.,0.);\n    val += vec3(0.,0.,sphereSDF(uv, .05*abs(sin(0.+iTime*6.))+.25, vec2(.4,.0)));\n    val += vec3(0.,sphereSDF(uv, .05*abs(sin(400.+iTime*6.))+.25, vec2(-.4,.0)), 0.);\n\n    fragColor = vec4(vec3(val), 1.);\n}\n", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}